teria of policy KES-72158 v3, each documented in the record\n- \u00a72.1 Qualifying lumbar diagnosis [P2]\n- Diagnosis M54.16 recorded 2026-05-17 (record Condition/north-004000-dx) [E8]\n- \u00a72.3 Documented neurological examination [P3]\n- Note of 2026-10-05 documents: straight leg raise, motor strength, deep tendon reflex, sensation to light touch (record DocumentReference/demo-neuro-exam-note) [E9]\n- \u00a72.4 Renal function before contrast (eGFR) [P4]\n- eGFR 71.4 on 2026-09-07 (needs >= 30) (record Observation/north-004000-r3) [E10]\n\nRequest\nOn the evidence cited above, the criteria of the policy in force are met. We request that the determination be reversed.\n\nAttestation: pending review and approval by the treating physician.","draft_version":1,"unsupported_criteria":[]},"created_at":"2026-10-05T01:03:39.315919+00:00","started_at":"2026-10-05T01:03:39.593671+00:00","finished_at":"2026-10-05T01:03:39.599336+00:00"}},"blocked":{"status":403,"body":{"type":"https://errors.example/forbidden","title":"forbidden","status":403,"code":"forbidden","detail":"role 'coordinator' lacks permission 'appeals:approve'"}},"approved":{"status":200,"body":{"case_id":"01a10996-7a20-7217-984a-1ff17b2dd7b1","status":"appeal_approved","draft_version":1,"approved_by":"Physician (Northside)"}},"outcome":{"status":200,"body":{"id":"01a10996-7a20-7217-984a-1ff17b2dd7b1","status":"overturned","priority":"routine","due_at":"2026-10-12T01:03:39.040350+00:00","mrn":"MRN-DEMO-0001","procedure_code":"72158","procedure":"MRI lumbar spine, without then with contrast","diagnosis_codes":["M54.16"],"payer":"Kestrel Mutual","created_at":"2026-10-05T01:03:39.038518+00:00","decided_at":"2026-10-05T01:03:39.653508+00:00","external_case_id":"SIM-775EC77157","policy":{"key":"KES-72158","version":"3","source_uri":"policy://kes/72158/v3","title":"MRI lumbar spine, without then with contrast: medical necessity policy"},"approval_likelihood":{"value":0.9335,"model_version":"approval-gb-1.0.0","use":